    <briefdescription>
<para>Determine if all types in Ts are distinct. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Useful to statically assert when Ts is intended to describe a non-multi set of types.</para>
<para>Expensive (currently quadratic in sizeof(Ts...)), and so should only be asserted once per instantiation of a type which requires it. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
